    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Nestled in the heart of a peaceful Victorian street just off South Circular Road, Number 51 is a beautifully presented mid-terrace period residence offering a seamless blend of traditional elegance and contemporary style. Extending to approximately 1,044 sq ft / 97 sq m, this light-filled and deceptively spacious two-bedroom home is in immaculate, walk-in condition — perfect for those looking to move in without lifting a finger.\r\nStep through the front door into a bright and welcoming hallway, complete with solid timber floors, intricate cornicing, and lofty ceilings — all hallmarks of its period character. To the left lies a generously proportioned living room/bedroom, featuring an original cast iron fireplace with open fire, bespoke built-in bookcases, and the continuation of those beautiful timber floors.\r\nDouble doors lead into the heart of the home — a stunning kitchen with high ceilings, Velux windows, a brand-new fitted units, integrated appliances, and a cozy new wood-burning stove. This space flows effortlessly into the sunroom, where a glazed vaulted ceiling and newly tiled floors create a serene atmosphere ideal for morning coffees or unwinding with a good book.\r\nOff the sunroom lie spacious office/guestroom and a bedroom, both with built-in wardrobes. One enjoys the benefit of a newly refurbished ensuite, while the other has access to a stylish Jack and Jill bathroom — also recently upgraded and thoughtfully appointed.\r\nThe rear garden is low maintenance, featuring gravel, flower beds, and pedestrian access. A separate utility/storage room houses the gas boiler and is plumbed for a washing machine and dryer.\r\nGreenville Terrace is a tranquil, tree-lined enclave just minutes from the vibrant buzz of Dublin City. St. Stephen’s Green and Grafton Street are within a 15–20 minute walk, while the trendy Camden Quarter — with its mix of cafés, gourmet shops, and nightlife — is just 10 minutes away. Excellent transport links are on your doorstep, with the Luas and numerous bus routes offering easy access throughout the city and beyond."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hall\t\t\t\t\t5.58m * 1.27m\r\nWalnut-stained solid timber floors. Attic access. Coving. Phone point. Alarm.\r\n\r\nLiving Room/Bedroom \t\t4.38m * 4.29m\r\nWalnut-stained solid timber floors. Original cast iron fireplace. Bookshelves. TV point. Cornicing and centre rose.\r\n\r\nKitchen\t\t\t\t\t4.25m * 4.18m\r\nOriginal cast iron fireplace with wood burning stove built in. New fully fitted floor and wall units. Quartz worktops and splashback. Recess stainless steel sink unit. Integrated electric oven and hob. Extractor fan. Integrated fridge/freezer. Integrated Dishwasher. Hotpress with immersion. 2 x Velux windows. Recess lighting. Double doors to –\r\n\r\nSunroom\t\t\t\t7.2m * 2.43m\r\nTiled floor. Vaulted, glazed ceiling. Wall mounted lighting.\r\n\r\nOffice/Guestroom\t\t\t4m * 2.77m\r\nSolid wood floor. Built in wardrobes. Velux window. Door to bathroom. TV Point.\r\n\r\nBathroom\t\t\t\t3.2m * 1.48m\r\nTiled floor. WC. Bath with shower. Part tiled wall. Attic access. Velux windows. Heated towel rail.\r\n\r\nBedroom \t\t\t\t3.2m * 2.77m\r\nSolid wood floor. Built in wardrobes. Attic access. TV point. Velux window.\r\n\r\nEnsuite\t\t\t\t\t1.67m * 1.3m\r\nTiled floor. Wet room. Wash hand basin. WC.\r\n\r\nGarden\t\t\t\t\t3.88m * 3.75m\r\nGravel. Flower beds. Pedestrian rear access.\r\n\r\nShed/Utility Room\t\t\t1.73m * 1.12m\r\nTiled floor. Glow worm gas boiler. Plumbed for washing machine. Dryer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Mid-terrace period home in walk-in condition\r\n2 spacious double bedrooms\r\n2 newly refurbished bathrooms (including Jack and Jill)\r\nLight-filled living and kitchen areas\r\nSunroom with vaulted ceiling\r\nOriginal features including cast iron fireplace and timber floors\r\nGas central heating\r\nSeparate utility/storage room\r\nPedestrian rear access\r\nPrime city location near excellent amenities and transport links"
      },
